---
import PageLayout from "../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "Wholesale Cosmetic & Skin Research Peptides",
  "description": "Factory-direct GHK-Cu, Snap-8, Leuphasyl, Argireline, Matrixyl. ≥99% HPLC purity, batch-traceable, tiered wholesale pricing.",
  "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "name": "Peptides Source Hub", "url": "https://peptidesourcehub.com" },
};

const products = [
  ["GHK-Cu","49557-75-7","340.4 (GHK)","Copper peptide — wound healing & collagen synthesis","50 mg × 10 vials"],
  ["Snap-8","—","1,073.2","Acetyl octapeptide-3 — SNAP-25 inhibitor, anti-wrinkle","10 mg × 10 vials"],
  ["Leuphasyl","—","623.7","Pentapeptide-18 — enkephalin analogue, muscle relaxant","10 mg × 10 vials"],
  ["Argireline","616204-22-9","889.0","Acetyl hexapeptide-8 — neurotransmitter inhibition","10 mg × 10 vials"],
  ["Matrixyl","214047-00-4","803.9","Palmitoyl pentapeptide-4 — collagen fragment signal","10 mg × 10 vials"],
];

const matrix = [
  ["GHK-Cu","Skin regeneration, wound repair","Tissue remodeling research","—"],
  ["Snap-8","Expression line inhibition","Wrinkle reduction models","Argireline"],
  ["Leuphasyl","Muscle contraction modulation","Fine line models","Snap-8"],
  ["Argireline","Neurotransmitter inhibition","Expression line research","Snap-8"],
  ["Matrixyl","Collagen synthesis signaling","Anti-aging formulation","GHK-Cu"],
];
const faqJson = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What cosmetic research peptides are available?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "GHK-Cu (copper tripeptide, 50mg) and additional cosmetic peptides in our catalog. All ≥99% HPLC purity with batch-specific COA."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How is GHK-Cu quality verified?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "≥99% HPLC purity, ESI-MS identity, and UV-Vis spectroscopy (600nm peak) verifying copper chelation. Dedicated HPLC gradient optimized for copper-peptide analysis."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Why does GHK-Cu appear blue?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The characteristic blue color confirms successful Cu²⁺ chelation by the GHK tripeptide. This is a quality indicator — absorbance at 600nm corresponds to the copper d-d transition."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What documentation is included?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "COA, commercial invoice, packing list with every order. Additional analytical data on request. Full technical dossier for bulk orders."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How should cosmetic peptides be stored?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Lyophilized: 2-8°C, desiccated, protected from light. GHK-Cu is photolabile — protect from direct light during storage. Reconstituted: tinted vials recommended."}}]};
---

<PageLayout
  title="Wholesale Cosmetic & Skin Research Peptides — GHK-Cu, Snap-8"
  description="Factory-direct GHK-Cu, Snap-8, Leuphasyl, Argireline, Matrixyl. ≥99% HPLC purity, tiered wholesale pricing. COA with every order."
  {jsonLd}
>

<section class="section bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-primary-light relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 hero-grid opacity-20"></div>
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 animate-on-scroll">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-sm" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white">Home</a><span class="text-gray-600">/</span>
      <a href="/products/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white">Products</a><span class="text-gray-600">/</span>
      <span class="text-accent">Cosmetic & Skin</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-5xl">Cosmetic & Skin Peptides</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mt-4 max-w-2xl">Dermatological research & cosmetic formulation — factory-direct, batch-traceable</p>
    <div class="card bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-white border-pink-200 mt-6 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Key Statistics</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">2</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Core Peptides</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">≥99%</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">HPLC Purity Standard</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Cu²⁺</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Bioactive Complex (GHK-Cu)</span></div>
        <div><span class="block text-2xl font-bold text-primary">10-70%</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Bulk Discount Range</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Cosmetic peptides are the fastest-growing segment in topical research peptide supply — driven by demand for evidence-backed ingredients in dermatological formulation studies. GHK-Cu remains the anchor of this category: a naturally occurring copper tripeptide with well-characterized effects on collagen synthesis and tissue remodeling. Snap-8 and Argireline extend into neurotransmitter modulation pathways for expression line research.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary group">Get a Quote <svg class="w-4 h-4 inline transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/blog/peptide-quality-guide/" class="btn-outline text-primary border-primary/30 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Peptide Quality Guide →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dot-pattern">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-10">Product Specifications</h2>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
      <table class="w-full text-sm bg-white">
        <thead><tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b-2 border-gray-200"><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Product</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-primary">CAS</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-primary">MW (Da)</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-primary">Research Context</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Std. Configuration</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {products.map((p,i)=>(<tr class={`border-b border-gray-100 ${i%2===0?'bg-white':'bg-gray-50/50'} hover:bg-accent/5`}><td class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">{p[0]}</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 text-xs font-mono">{p[1]}</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600">{p[2]}</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">{p[3]}</td><td class="py-3 px-5 font-medium text-accent-dark">{p[4]}</td></tr>))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-4 text-center">All products: ≥99% purity by HPLC · Lyophilized powder · COA included · Store at 2–8°C</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-surface">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-10">Cross-Selling Matrix</h2>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
      <table class="w-full text-sm bg-white">
        <thead><tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b-2 border-gray-200"><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Peptide</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Primary Application</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Research Use</th><th class="text-left py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">Pairs With</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {matrix.map((row,i)=>(<tr class={`border-b border-gray-100 ${i%2===0?'bg-white':'bg-gray-50/50'} hover:bg-accent/5`}><td class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold text-primary">{row[0]}</td><td class="py-3 px-5 text-gray-600 text-sm">{row[1]}</td><td class="py-3 px-5 text-gray-600 text-sm">{row[2]}</td><td class="py-3 px-5 text-accent-dark text-sm">{row[3]}</td></tr>))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container-narrow mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-10">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer"><summary class="font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent">What makes GHK-Cu different from other cosmetic peptides?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">GHK-Cu is a naturally occurring copper tripeptide with an unusually broad mechanism: it simultaneously modulates collagen synthesis, elastin production, glycosaminoglycan deposition, and metalloproteinase activity. Most other cosmetic peptides target a single pathway — GHK-Cu is a multi-target signal.</p></details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer"><summary class="font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent">Can Snap-8 and Argireline be used in the same formulation?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Yes. While both target neurotransmitter release, they act through different mechanisms — Argireline inhibits vesicle docking (SNAP-25 competitor), while Snap-8 targets the SNARE complex assembly. Combined use is a common multi-target strategy in topical research.</p></details>
      <details class="card group cursor-pointer"><summary class="font-semibold text-primary hover:text-accent">What purity is required for cosmetic formulation research?</summary><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 text-sm">Our standard ≥99% by HPLC is suitable for formulation studies requiring defined active concentrations. Lower-purity material increases the risk of off-target effects from peptide-related impurities.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-primary py-16 text-center">
  <div class="container-wide mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-white text-3xl mb-4">Ready to Source Cosmetic Peptides?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">Bulk pricing on all five cosmetic peptides. COA, HPLC, and MS documentation with every order.</p>
    <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary text-lg group">Request Wholesale Quote <svg class="w-4 h-4 inline transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="text-center py-6 bg-surface"><a href="/products/" class="text-accent-dark font-medium hover:underline">← Back to All Categories</a></div>

<script type="application/ld+json">{JSON.stringify(faqJson)}</script>
</PageLayout>
